# See https://help.github.com/articles/ignoring-files/ for more about ignoring files.

# Full-resolution source assets kept for re-editing. Deliberately outside
# public/ so they are never copied into the deployed build, and ignored here so
# the multi-MB originals stay out of the repo. public/headshot.jpg (the resized
# one actually served) IS committed — the deploy needs it.
/assets-source/

# dependencies
/node_modules
/.pnp
.pnp.js

# testing
/coverage

# production
# Build output is generated by CI (AWS Amplify Hosting) and must not be
# committed.
/build

# environment
# Note: CRA inlines REACT_APP_* vars into the public bundle at build time, so
# nothing secret belongs in any of these files regardless.
.env.local
.env.development.local
.env.test.local
.env.production.local

# logs
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

# editors / IDEs
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo

# OS cruft
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
